# PITHONIX AI - VERCEL ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION

To enable the JEVA Voice Agent and AI Reasoning Core, please add the following environment variables in your Vercel Dashboard (Settings > Environment Variables):

# 1. Google Gemini API (Neural Core)
# Get a key from: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Sarvam AI API (Voice Synthesis)
# Get a key from: https://www.sarvam.ai/
SARVAM_API_KEY=your_sarvam_api_key_here

# Notes:
# - Ensure these are added for both 'Development' and 'Production' environments.
# - The JEVA frontend communicates with the /api/jeva and /api/speak handlers.
